          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">No treadmill causes weight loss.</strong> The best one for a
            weight-loss routine is the one you will use comfortably most days, and that means
            powered incline, a roomy cushioned deck, a continuous-rated motor sized for daily use,
            weight capacity headroom and enough quiet to use it when you have time.
          </p>
